{"id":"gta6-GTA6_style_text_only","revision":0,"last_node_id":14,"last_link_id":32,"nodes":[{"id":1,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-550,90],"size":[480,640],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"How to use","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## GTA VI style, Qwen-Image 2.1\n\nWork left to right:\n\n1. **Models**: Qwen-Image 2.1 base + Turbo, text encoder and VAE.\n2. **Photo(s)**: load your photo(s).\n3. **Clean-up** (optional, switch on by default): a fast Turbo edit puts each photo on a plain studio background\n   with even light, so busy backgrounds don't leak into the illustration.\n4. **Your settings**: pick a **Theme**; set each **person** (hair, outfit, accessory, pose, or `keep from photo`);\n   choose a **group setup** and add your own specifics in `your_prompt`. The preview shows the exact prompt.\n5. **Generate**: the base model draws the scene. Change the seed here for variations.\n\nGrey \"subgraph\" nodes hide plumbing you rarely need; double-click one to open it.\nRTX 3060 12 GB, 1248x832, 40 steps: ~26 s clean-up per photo, ~66-80 s generate (plus model swaps).\n"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## GTA VI style, Qwen-Image 2.1\n\nWork left to right:\n\n1. **Models**: Qwen-Image 2.1 base + Turbo, text encoder and VAE.\n2. **Photo(s)**: load your photo(s).\n3. **Clean-up** (optional, switch on by default): a fast Turbo edit puts each photo on a plain studio background\n   with even light, so busy backgrounds don't leak into the illustration.\n4. **Your settings**: pick a **Theme**; set each **person** (hair, outfit, accessory, pose, or `keep from photo`);\n   choose a **group setup** and add your own specifics in `your_prompt`. The preview shows the exact prompt.\n5. **Generate**: the base model draws the scene. Change the seed here for variations.\n\nGrey \"subgraph\" nodes hide plumbing you rarely need; double-click one to open it.\nRTX 3060 12 GB, 1248x832, 40 steps: ~26 s clean-up per photo, ~66-80 s generate (plus model sw